# Line endings.
#
# The repository stores text as LF, and a Windows checkout gets CRLF for the
# things Windows tooling actually reads: batch files. ЗАПУСТИТЬ.bat contains
# parenthesised `if (...)` blocks, and cmd.exe parses those more reliably with
# CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=crlf

# Binary assets. The game ships none, but the offline renderer writes PNGs.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
